<article class="env-lemma" id="07XT">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/07XT">Lemma <span data-tag="07XT">98.13.3</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a locally Noetherian scheme. Let $\mathcal{X}$ be a category fibred in groupoids over $(\mathit{Sch}/S)_{fppf}$. Let $U$ be a scheme locally of finite type over $S$. Let $x$ be an object of $\mathcal{X}$ over $U$. Assume that $x$ is versal at every finite type point of $U$ and that $\mathcal{X}$ satisfies (RS). Then $x : (\mathit{Sch}/U)_{fppf} \to \mathcal{X}$ satisfies (<a href="/tag/07XS" data-tag="07XS">98.13.2.1</a>). </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Let $\mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(l) \to U$ be a morphism with $l$ of finite type over $S$. Then the image $u_0 \in U$ is a finite type point of $U$ and $l/\kappa (u_0)$ is a finite extension, see discussion in Morphisms, Section <a href="/tag/01T9" data-tag="01T9">29.16</a>. Hence we see that $\mathcal{F}_{(\mathit{Sch}/U)_{fppf}, l, u_{l, 0}} \to \mathcal{F}_{\mathcal{X}, l, x_{l, 0}}$ is smooth by Lemma <a href="/tag/07XG" data-tag="07XG">98.12.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>